message: "If you use these rectangles or this code, please cite them as below."
title: "Balanced Latin Rectangles: New Best-Known Values via Simple Local Search"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Zhengyu
    affiliation: Georgia Institute of Technology
